
Quick recap
The meeting introduced team members from ISC and HSBC to discuss a GenAI project, focusing on roles and structure with ISC planning to start with three main positions while HSBC shared detailed requirements for an insurance underwriting project in Hong Kong. The team reviewed document processing needs, including handling various types of insurance forms, medical reports, and ID documents across different languages and formats, with discussions centered on information extraction capabilities and quality checks. The conversation ended with plans to create dummy samples for testing, review POC prompts and extractions, and continue discussions on Discord, with specific focus on document verification and UI mapping.
 
